{
  "title": "Push/MaX-Traction",
  "author": "Idan Gafni",
  "notes": "25+ EY. High extraction low body beverage. Requires grinding of about 200+ microns from burrs lock. This profile is a dedicated profile to light roasted coffees that are more challenging to extract. The increased extraction is achieved by using various extraction mechanics such as multiple fills with fresh water,multiple blooms, and contact time. With high flow baskets (unibasket, sworks flow, wafo soe, pesado etc) it will drizzle throughout the extraction.",
